{"4052530": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bloody Fate", "steam_appid": 4052530, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Just Updated</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052530/extras/f9719be9b51862cc173665d2c18ff728.avif?t=1781669947\" width=736 height=736 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Update v1.0.2: Bug Fixes &amp; Stability Improvements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Açıklama:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We’ve just released a hotfix to improve your experience in <strong>Bloody Fate</strong>. This update focuses on resolving known issues and enhancing game stability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fixes include:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resolved a rare crash occurring during dialogue sequences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fixed an issue where the weapon sound would sometimes loop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Performance optimizations for smoother frame rates.</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BLOODY FATE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After avenging his friend, Nico Moretti ignites a war in the underworld. Though uneasy about being part of this life, he gradually realizes he has stepped onto a path with no return.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BLOODY FATE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After avenging his friend, Nico Moretti ignites a war in the underworld. Though uneasy about being part of this life, he gradually realizes he has stepped onto a path with no return.</p>", "short_description": "After avenging his friend, Nico Moretti ignites a war in the underworld. Though uneasy about being part of this life, he gradually realizes he has stepped onto a path with no return.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>,